Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my\Nstruggles shoot me through the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pity if we\Nlingered here and let our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sparks of life\Nblend aloud and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even you can't\Nnavigate If someone strong like you is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,then who will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves\Ncast, my heart exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been your kindness and your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor, ride as high as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure I don't need anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I go fast as I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're dashing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're never gonna fall, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world may now be my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:01:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Water swirls, but I ain't backing\Ndown so long as I'm free, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'd give it, come\Nround the current with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle atop the\NSkulldome has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner was previously Carrot,\Nbut now the outcome has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.24,0:02:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You were amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The skyboats are flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen this sight in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.32,0:03:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.36,0:03:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy defeated Kaido and\Nburied him deep in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The capital is safe at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke turned into a dragon\Nand stopped Onigashima from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That dragon was Lord Momonosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty long years we have waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The vengeance in our hearts has burned\Nhotter, brighter than any flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Until this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It is our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:03:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I really thought we were all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.78,0:04:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Always feels good to hunt big game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I feel like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shia really won?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That crazy rubber bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be creative!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be proud! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll tell him that we won!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone pushed themselves to the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like my job's only starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They soon need your help right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro's out and he won't wake up! Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, please help us! Okay. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.20,0:06:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, we need you here too! Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, the wound\Nreopens! Dr. Please! Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, you're not dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many patients!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for you, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Karoo, the whole\Ncastle for medical supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope we have enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,in the capital, the Fire Festival comes\Nto a close as the skyboats float away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard my dad used to be real important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:06:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew he'd die if he got caught,\Nand that's just what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But he didn't get tricked or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They said he got caught on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't my daddy do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yasui wanted to give\Nus a chance to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to save our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If he hadn't made that decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,every little flame of\Nhope that we lit over
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the last 20 years would\Nhave been snuffed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cover your children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dies for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The final Dome to serve Kozuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, the happy-go-lucky fool\Nfrom Evisutau makes his final journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His death was a noble sacrifice, one\Nthat ensured the land of Wano's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He and his allies wanted\Nto create a country
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,where you could be safe\Nand happy every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He did all that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you eat that fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you never to eat those?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I—I'm—I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.62,0:08:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I have some too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some real talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you'll be the best dancer\Nin the land of Wano someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You think? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, he just wants me\Nto live a happy life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll change the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That look good to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:10:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As a samurai, and as a father, there\Ncould be no greater honor, no greater joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And away you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuneesha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuneesha, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have thought it over carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't open the borders yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defer to your wisdom on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith in you, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't celebrate yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we saw a number, you samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too late to surrender,\Nor else we're gonna blast ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that Commander Kaido lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And an emperor's crew won't lose either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't know when to quit, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you punks wanna fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody left in a snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Space pirates, lay down your arms at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You not only lost to your enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have died if not for their aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When Kaido was defeated,\Nhis clouds vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think stopped\Nthis island from falling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Momonosuke, the\Nleader of our troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is your enemy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:11:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You awano your lives if you bare\Nyour fangs at Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy to take what he's due!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole island is shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Babanuki, sir! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it on the screen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.26,0:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one damn thing after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go check on it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle in the sky has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner, previously Kaido,\Nis now Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,An eruption?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was close to Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been the\Nrumble we just felt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming his way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not a crisis!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaido! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only day of the year\Nwe're free from that monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That eruption was nothing more\Nthan Kaido's final farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The leader of the Beast\NPirates has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon just disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of them are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But we just had her\Nfuneral. Are you telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,that she's a ghost this\Nmust be some kind of trick
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Yoshido, wait — what\Nhappened to your pompadour?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you've got it all wrong. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.38,0:16:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragon wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean there are two dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Kiyoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Komurasaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks just like her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on in front of the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss Kiyoshino, you gotta explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you have become quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wonder if they'll\Nremember the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been 20 years after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Foxfire Kin'emon? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They said he burned along with the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,or some sort of trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we didn't die, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we in the afterworld?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming or not, I\Ndon't want to miss this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like something\Namazing is about to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yuga-suga!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kawamatsu Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Dog Storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Race of the Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Cat Viper and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Kikunojo of the Fallen Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Paws, what is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:18:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To start, Napping Kyoshiro was a\Nfalse name to obscure my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, though my face has changed, I\Nam a member of the Akazaya Nine! Denjiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Legendary samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They came back for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I would see the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little,\NI thought they were dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Toki was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Her last words were true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one hell of a story!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the light scroll!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to broadcast this right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.84,0:18:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the whole country know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.56,0:18:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A broadcast from the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening at the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this about the earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the whole region was done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on there's a\Nmessage from the Capitol
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we're about to watch\Nnow start off the light
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Scroll your kind of son? Yep,\Nthat's me. You're looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,for a beat down stop\Nresisting you know we won
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,huh don't you try anything\Nfunny because we are
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,super tired and we will\Nprobably lose no no wait I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not your enemy. I've been\Nfollowing your story in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the newspaper for quite\Nsome time though in person
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a little more unusual\Nlooking than i expected
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,are you really human you're\Nthe one with horns bro
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,so you're kaito's son huh stand back nami
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.80,0:20:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm coming to save you my name is yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but you may also call me kozuki odin today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,i will be joining your\Ncrew nice to meet you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a funny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't personally object, but our\Ncaptain is the one who has the final word.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to run it by him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he's okay after all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The way he fought gave\Nme chills. It was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just whoosh, bang, boom\Nall over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.78,0:21:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah we gotta go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We showed them no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll definitely do the same to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say you could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master don't move\Nor I'll pound your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.50,0:21:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don't you know it's\Nunbecoming of a soldier to flee?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll take this like a man! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're not our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, speaking of which, what's\Ngoing to happen to the two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My power will wear off\Nwhen the same moon rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it'll take a whole month?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes when the animals\Nturn back to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,they decide they don't\Nwant to be friends anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But others decide to hang\Naround and stay buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it depends on their personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.78,0:22:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess, in the end, they just\Nchoose whatever makes them happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.86,0:22:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be happy if we can\Nstay just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.02,0:22:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Marcelino, I'd be happy if\Nyou stayed with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But not as a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe more like a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, we can be together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.26,0:22:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Nyou've truly brought me joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:22:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad, but can you hold me\Na little less tight, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm choking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.28,0:23:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're kneeling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.50,0:23:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think someone else is about to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.98,0:23:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 20 years since my\Nfather, Kozuki Oden, died.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.75,0:23:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.88,0:23:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You have endured many hardships,\Nbut those days have come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:24:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire festival will continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You may carry on however you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.94,0:24:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But what did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.22,0:24:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You may drink as much as\Nyou like. Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well water will be free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.00,0:24:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The factories will not be\Nallowed to poison the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.98,0:24:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one shall live as a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.42,0:24:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.78,0:24:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your suffering is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Four more died at the factory today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.44,0:24:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Might be me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.78,0:24:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to tell Otama.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.62,0:25:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother and father aren't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, Dad, you can rest in peace, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be just fine. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.40,0:25:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't deal. You're tickling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.56,0:25:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Woven hats for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.82,0:25:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anybody need a hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.62,0:25:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Quality guaranteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.72,0:25:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't find a better deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.88,0:25:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need a new hat, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.74,0:25:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.36,0:25:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Find woven hats for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.84,0:25:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll protect you from the snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.50,0:26:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I couldn't sew any hats, but\Nit's okay. I'll just try again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.00,0:26:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have a hat, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.92,0:26:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A tingle!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.40,0:26:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an orphan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.96,0:26:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few years more,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.08,0:26:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the samurai of the Kozuki clan\Nwill return to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.06,0:27:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And the demons who took control of this\Ncountry will be brought to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.68,0:27:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A tingle!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.26,0:27:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.46,0:27:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll work hard till then!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.82,0:27:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be strong like the\Nsamurai from the Kozuki clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.50,0:27:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is keep believing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.18,0:27:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.66,0:27:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.84,0:27:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.08,0:27:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, I'm gonna make this a normal thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.88,0:27:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear that by the time we leave Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.50,0:27:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be a place where you can\Neat as much as you want every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.02,0:28:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You need not fear Orochi or Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.56,0:28:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Their reign of terror is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.72,0:28:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I traveled the seas and\Nmade powerful new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.02,0:28:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,With the ninja pirate\Nmink samurai alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We raided Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.00,0:28:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi, Kaido, and the beast pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.64,0:28:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We faced all the evils that\Nthreatened this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.14,0:28:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the end, we emerged victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.10,0:28:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you took on those\Nmonsters and actually won?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.56,0:28:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have to battle\Non our team anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.86,0:28:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not in a damned alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.82,0:28:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean we're going\Nto be happy every day now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.96,0:29:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! We got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.90,0:29:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you could\Nescape from this nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.08,0:29:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.36,0:29:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.64,0:29:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fallen allies who helped us save\Nthis land will never be forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.96,0:29:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.50,0:29:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What else should I say to my people?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.00,0:29:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is your time to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.96,0:30:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything left in the\Nworld that can scare you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.42,0:30:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The name that my father gave\Nme means peerless among men.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.36,0:30:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Under my rule, this broken land\Nshall become a paradise on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.36,0:30:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me your strength and let us\Nwork toward this end together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.50,0:30:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For I have traveled 20 years\Nthrough time to save this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.92,0:30:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.58,0:30:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Kozuki Momonosuke, will\Nlead the land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.06,0:31:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I will keep my promise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, I will follow in your footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.36,0:31:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Closity clan is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.36,0:32:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a real Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.42,0:32:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you\Nfor so long! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.68,0:32:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I called my escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.02,0:32:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A new dawn breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.18,0:32:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The warriors sheath their swords, and\Nflower petals flutter in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.38,0:32:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The land has a new leader, a handsome\Nyoung man of eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.34,0:32:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,gazes to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.34,0:32:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He is not a man of great strength, But\Nhe is loyal and kind like no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.24,0:32:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Momonosuke steps forth as\Nthe Land of Wano's proud shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.28,0:32:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,With his samurai at his side, he\Nwill forge his place in history.
